# C2: the reading narrates its own computation at the ordinary window size.
# Needs a provisioned persona in MERE_ROOT; a fresh root refuses to open.
wait
assert snap fields == 1
c2-author-layout
wait
c2-read-layout
wait
assert snap readings == 3
advance
wait
assert snap reflections == 1
assert text How this reading was made
assert text operating-system randomness
assert text this deck has no reversed cards
reveal key reading-context reading-context
settle 2
capture reading-first-viewport
reveal key scene-card scene-card:tension
settle 2
hover key scene-card scene-card:tension
settle 2
assert text presses on what I hold
capture hover-tension
unhover key scene-card scene-card:tension
settle 2
reveal key reading-narrative reading-narrative
settle 2
capture narration
reveal key reflection-examples reflection-examples
settle 2
capture reflection-examples
resize 420 760
wait
reveal key scene-card scene-card:next_step
settle 2
assert visible key scene-card scene-card:next_step
capture compact-third-card
reveal key reading-narrative reading-narrative
settle 2
capture compact-narration
